kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781750/extras/d20dd5eb60fb56a7b5598635274bd4ba.mp4?t=1749809778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With a clumsy mother like Akiko and her kind daughters Haruka and Chika, your new daily life will be different from what you were used to. Spend time and learn more about your new family, forming a unique and heartwarming bond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781750/extras/b3080fd86cb098a02fbb2a3e4163ad9b.avif?t=1749809778\" width=600 height=166 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781750/extras/df3943ad3576e687553d47e6fd10a740.poster.avif?t=1749809778\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781750/extras/df3943ad3576e687553d47e6fd10a740.webm?t=1749809778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781750/extras/df3943ad3576e687553d47e6fd10a740.mp4?t=1749809778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Featuring fully voiced and animated scenes, feel each character's personality and intentions more vividly and naturally as you dive into the story. Each scene was carefully thought out and created to keep you hooked from the very first moment you start your new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join our discord</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781750/extras/bd77d7f0c725f9fab34ce90219b2137e.avif?t=1749809778\" width=600 height=166 /></span></p>",
